file lotus/README.md front door synced — the road-on paragraph accretes ALES45 after ALES44
recommend keep-going ALES46 is agent-doable and purely local Lindy-first crux-first: a carried shelf/stack (a whole EQ that spans a re-berthed region), a high-pass sweep (ALES44's schedule over the carried high-pass), or the real time base (a check-in seam — a crossover in hertz). Hardware/funds/serve stay custody gates for Keaton's hand.
